~ start
if first_interaction:
	=> first_interaction
else:
	=> regular
	
~ first_interaction
do set_avatar("upasana")
Upasana: HAPPY BIRTHDAY! Sreejita!
Upasana: Congratulations on turning 22.
do set_avatar("sree")
You: Thank you! How was the cake?
do set_avatar("upasana")
Upasana: Omg! the cake was soo good!
do set_avatar("sree")
You: Glad you liked it so much.
do set_avatar("upasana")
Upasana: Oo, and here is your gift.

do Ui.gift_box.give_gift("makeup")
do Ui.invetory_show_makeup()

Upasana: There is a set of highlighters, blush and bronzer, 2 blenders... 
Upasana: A brush set, a set of eye pencils and 2 lipsticks.
do set_avatar("sree")
You: Omg! these colors are so cute, thank you so much!!!
You: I will wear these in Puja, when we go out.
do set_avatar("upasana")
Upasana: Oh, great tell me what you will wear, we'll match.
do set_avatar("sree")
You: Okay, we will discuss and match outfits

set first_interaction = false
do EventManager.finish_task(EventManager.task_ids.talk_to_upasana)
=> END

~ regular
do set_avatar("upasana")
%1 Upasana: Send me a selfie if you try the makeup out.
%1 Upasana: Don't forget to tell what you will be wearing in Puja

=> END